#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Introduction to primitives in Qiskit Runtime, and an explanation of "
"available primitives"
msgstr ""
"Introduction aux primitives dans Qiskit Runtime, et explication des "
"primitives disponibles"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives"
msgstr "Introduction aux primitives"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives {#introduction-to-primitives}"
msgstr "Introduction aux primitives {#introduction-to-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Primitives were created to simplify the most common tasks for quantum "
"computers: namely, sampling quantum states and calculating expectation "
"values. The first Qiskit Runtime primitives "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) and "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) are implementations of the Qiskit [primitives base "
"classes](/guides/primitives). They provide a more sophisticated "
"implementation (for example, by including error mitigation) as a cloud-based"
" service and are used to access IBM Quantum&reg; hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les primitives ont été créées pour simplifier les tâches les plus courantes "
"des ordinateurs quantiques : à savoir, l'échantillonnage des états "
"quantiques et le calcul des valeurs d'espérance. Les premières primitives "
"Qiskit Runtime ([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) et "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) sont des implémentations des classes de base des "
"[primitives Qiskit](/guides/primitives). Elles fournissent une "
"implémentation plus sophistiquée (par exemple, en incluant l'atténuation "
"d'erreurs) en tant que service basé sur le cloud et sont utilisées pour "
"accéder au matériel IBM Quantum&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The newest Qiskit Runtime primitive, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) "
"(which is in beta), provides a lower-level interface that gives more "
"visibility and control without sacrificing performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"La plus récente primitive Qiskit Runtime, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) (en"
" version bêta), fournit une interface de plus bas niveau qui offre plus de "
"visibilité et de contrôle sans sacrifier les performances.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Computes the expectation values for one or more observables with respect to states prepared by quantum circuits.  Has built-in error suppression and mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Calcule les valeurs d'espérance pour un ou plusieurs observables par rapport aux états préparés par des circuits quantiques. Dispose de méthodes intégrées de suppression et d'atténuation d'erreurs.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Démarrage rapide avec Estimator\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples the output register from the execution of one or more quantum circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Échantillonne le registre de sortie à partir de l'exécution d'un ou plusieurs circuits quantiques.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Démarrage rapide avec Sampler\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples output registers from quantum circuit executions based on input directives and gives you full control and transparency over customizing error mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (bêta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Échantillonne les registres de sortie des exécutions de circuits quantiques sur la base de directives d'entrée et te donne un contrôle et une transparence totaux sur la personnalisation des méthodes d'atténuation d'erreurs.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Démarrage rapide avec Executor\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Étapes suivantes {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn about the [Qiskit primitives](/guides/primitives) that the Qiskit Runtime primitives are based on.\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), or [Executor](/guides/executor-examples) examples.\n"
"- See the input and output details for [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), and [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- See the [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), and [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommandations\">\n"
"- Découvre les [primitives Qiskit](/guides/primitives) sur lesquelles sont basées les primitives Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"- Consulte des exemples détaillés pour [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples) ou [Executor](/guides/executor-examples).\n"
"- Consulte les détails d'entrée et de sortie pour [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output) et [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Entraîne-toi à utiliser les primitives en suivant la [leçon sur la fonction de coût](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) dans IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Consulte la [référence API EstimatorV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), la [référence API SamplerV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2) et la [référence API Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Lis [Migrer vers les primitives V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
